{%- comment -%}
  Built-in scent illustrations, drawn for this theme: a fine ink line drawing with a
  soft colour fill on a pale disc in the note's own tint (48 x 48 grid, so they stay
  crisp at the 30px chip size). Decorative only (aria-hidden): the note's name is
  always written out in text next to it.

  Usage: {% render 'perfume-note-art', note: 'lemon' %}
  Notes: lemon, orange, bergamot, grapefruit, mint, apple, lavender, rose, jasmine, orange_blossom, iris, vanilla, cinnamon, pepper, cardamom, cedar, vetiver, patchouli, musk, amber, tonka, mineral, tobacco.
  Anything else renders nothing. Preview: dev/note-icons.html.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Real photos win over drawings ("no icons"):
  - a transparent cut-out in assets/ (lemon) on a disc in the note's colour;
  - Unsplash photos (free Unsplash licence, linked from Unsplash's image CDN as its
    guidelines ask; list in docs/CREDITS.md), cropped round.
  Patchouli and tonka have no suitable free photo yet (2026-11-22: Unsplash only
  had unrelated cakes/leaves): they keep the drawing.
  A fragrance_note metaobject's own image still wins where the section passes it.
  Pass style: 'drawing' to force the drawing.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign photo_file = ''
  assign photo_url = ''
  assign photo_tint = ''
  unless style == 'drawing'
    case note
      when 'lemon'
        assign photo_file = 'sample-scent-lemon.webp'
        assign photo_tint = '#FBF1C4'
      when 'cinnamon'
        assign photo_url = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553499944-e4297a0af1bd?w=240&h=240&fit=crop&q=70&auto=format'
      when 'vanilla'
        assign photo_url = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1682482198446-4cbf92f85a4b?w=240&h=240&fit=crop&q=70&auto=format'
      when 'lavender'
        assign photo_url = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611625105602-42ee06be977e?w=240&h=240&fit=crop&q=70&auto=format'
      when 'iris'
        assign photo_url = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1776372294959-e78a71c2af84?w=240&h=240&fit=crop&q=70&auto=format'
      when 'vetiver'
        assign photo_url = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563364664-399838d1394c?w=240&h=240&fit=crop&q=70&auto=format'
      when 'cedar'
        assign photo_url = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515446134809-993c501ca304?w=240&h=240&fit=crop&q=70&auto=format'
      when 'bergamot'
        assign photo_url = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612253167527-0598073d2979?w=240&h=240&fit=crop&q=70&auto=format'
      when 'pepper'
        assign photo_url = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1652128288742-df890f000a56?w=240&h=240&fit=crop&q=70&auto=format'
      when 'rose'
        assign photo_url = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585768750637-ada36319a484?w=240&h=240&fit=crop&q=70&auto=format'
      when 'jasmine'
        assign photo_url = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1781707533179-9c296c975a04?w=240&h=240&fit=crop&q=70&auto=format'
      when 'orange_blossom'
        assign photo_url = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1651057280467-6fb1f9001c78?w=240&h=240&fit=crop&q=70&auto=format'
